DTSTAMP:20260925T000000Z
DTSTART:20260925T090000
DTEND:20260925T110000
SUMMARY:Homeschool explorer day at Fort Morgan
DESCRIPTION:Gulf Coast Explorers runs a morning field programme at Fort Mo
 rgan\, the masonry fort that guarded the mouth of Mobile Bay. It took the
  brunt of the Battle of Mobile Bay in 1864. The programme covers the fort
 's role in coastal defence and works through the cannons and the tunnels.
  It is built for grades 3 to 12\, and a parent or responsible adult has t
 o come along. The operator books by request rather than selling seats\, s
 o this one starts with an email.\nPrice: not published by the venue\, so 
 confirm before you go\nArea: Orange Beach & Gulf Shores\nTimes: Friday 9/
 25 · 9:00 AM to 12:00 PM\nhttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-homesch
 ool-explorer-day-fort-morgan-and-mobi-0925.html
LOCATION:Fort Morgan State Historic Site\, 110 State Highway 180\, Gulf Sh
 ores\, AL 36542
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-homeschool-explorer-day-fort-mo
 rgan-and-mobi-0925.html
